</table></a></td></tr>
<tr>
<td class="cf-card" bgcolor="#ffffff" style="background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e1e5ec;border-radius:14px;padding:36px 40px;font-family:Geist,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif"><h1 class="cf-h1 cf-ink" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Geist,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:26px;line-height:32px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.4px;color:#0a0c10">Hold your spot</h1>
<p class="cf-text" style="margin:0 0 20px;font-family:Geist,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#2b313b">SupportGenius is admitting members in join order. Confirm your address to hold your place on the waitlist.</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:4px 0 24px"><tr>
<td class="cf-btn" bgcolor="#5b9dff" style="border-radius:10px;background:#5b9dff"><a class="cf-btn-a" href="https://supportgeni.us/v1/waitlist/confirm?token=abc123" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 24px;font-family:Geist,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:20px;font-weight:700;color:#0a0c10;text-decoration:none;border-radius:10px">Confirm my spot</a></td></tr>
</table><p class="cf-mut" style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:Geist,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#5b6472">If the button does not work, open this link:</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px;font-family:'Geist Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;word-break:break-all;overflow-wrap:anywhere"><a class="cf-link" href="https://supportgeni.us/v1/waitlist/confirm?token=abc123" style="color:#1f5fd1;text-decoration:underline">https://supportgeni.us/v1/waitlist/confirm?token=abc123</a></p>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr>
<td class="cf-rule" style="border-top:1px solid #e1e5ec;padding-top:20px"><p class="cf-mut" style="margin:0 0 8px;font-family:Geist,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:#5b6472">If you did not join this waitlist, ignore this email: nothing happens until the link is opened.</p>
</td></tr>
</table></td></tr>
<tr>
<td class="cf-mut" style="padding:24px 8px 0;font-family:Geist,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#5b6472"><p style="margin:0 0 6px">Sent to ada@example.com because this address was entered on the SupportGenius waitlist.</p>
